<title>INDIA: India produced 45,611 tonnes aluminium in May.</title>
<headline>India produced 45,611 tonnes aluminium in May.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 45,611 tonnes of aluminium in May against a target of 46,938 tonnes, a government statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>The country produced 88,826 tonnes of aluminium during April and May, compared with 76,638 tonnes in the same period in 1996, the statement said.</p>
<p>It said state-run National Aluminium Company Ltd</p>
<p>exported 25,000 tonnes of alumina and 4,653 tonnes of aluminium</p>
<p>in May.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Installed     May, 1997	 Cumulative output</p>
<p>	    capacity	---------	 -----------------</p>
<p>	    (annual)	  Actual	 Apr-May 97   Apr-May 96</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> BALCO    100,000	   7,218	   14,166	 14,901</p>
<p> INDAL    117,000	   3,196	    6,466	  4,792</p>
<p> HINDALCO 210,000	  15,486	   30,292	 18,441</p>
<p> NALCO    218,000	  17,540	   33,851	 34,725</p>
<p> MALCO     25,000	   2,171	    4,051	  3,779</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - </p>
<p> Total    670,000	  45,611	   88,826	 76,638</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes.</p>
